// newtnrLabelDateInputLine: a date input line whose date can only be picked (the NPR's
// newtNRLabelDateInputLine, "no recognition"): writing is not recognised, and any
// attempt to edit it opens the date popup.
//
// This file holds newtnrLabelDateInputLine and what only it reaches.

// flavor: the NewtApp filter that makes and reads the text (newtFilter)
// access 'pickOnly: the value can only be set with the filter's picker, not written
newtnrLabelDateInputLine := {_proto: @newtProtoLine, flavor: @newtDateFilter, access: 'pickOnly};
